The MIT licence above covers the code. Two parts of this repository are not
code and carry their own terms:

* model/weights.v*.json are trained on the Duolingo half-life regression
  dataset (doi:10.7910/DVN/N8XJME), released under CC BY-NC 4.0. The weights
  are derived from it and may not be used commercially.

* content/decks/german-a1.* is built from the FrequencyWords list
  (OpenSubtitles) under CC BY-SA 4.0 and is published under the same licence.
